{
    "title": "Cincinnati Bengals",
    "description": "This is the official mobile app of the Cincinnati Bengals. Make your Android device a unique part of your gameday experience for Bengals games. Want to catch breaking news of the team? See real-time statistics for every drive? Watch video-on-demand clips of press conferences and player interviews? Follow postgame blogs and pregame previews of the matchups?\r\n\r\nNow, you can stay in touch with the Bengals anytime, anywhere, on your Android device. \u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nFeatures include: \r\n\r\n\u2013 News: Real-time breaking news from the Bengals, previews of upcoming matchups, postgame news and blogs \r\n\u2013 Video: Video-on-demand clips of Bengals press conferences, and coach and player interviews \r\n\u2013 Photos: Gallery of game-time action \r\n\u2013 Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league \r\n\u2013 Standings: Division and conference standings \r\n\u2013 Fantasy: Keep track of your favorite fantasy players \r\n\u2013 Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams \r\n\u2013 Social media: Aggregated twitter of the Bengals official tweets, check in to the stadium on gameday, one-click tweet of all media items, one-click Facebook posting of all media items \r\n\u2013 Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games, and scores/stats of previous games from the season, ticket purchase for games \r\n\u2013 Evolving home-screen: Pregame, in-game, postgame, offseason countdown, draft-day\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html for more information.\r\n\r\nFollow us @bengals on Twitter for updates or visit bengals.com. \r\n\r\nFollow us @yinzcam on Twitter for updates or to ask questions and provide feedback.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is the official mobile app of the Cincinnati Bengals. Make your Android device a unique part of your gameday experience for Bengals games. Want to catch breaking news of the team? See real-time statistics for every drive? Watch video-on-demand clips of press conferences and player interviews? Follow postgame blogs and pregame previews of the matchups?<br><br>Now, you can stay in touch with the Bengals anytime, anywhere, on your Android device. \u2028\u2028<br><br>Features include: <br><br>\u2013 News: Real-time breaking news from the Bengals, previews of upcoming matchups, postgame news and blogs <br>\u2013 Video: Video-on-demand clips of Bengals press conferences, and coach and player interviews <br>\u2013 Photos: Gallery of game-time action <br>\u2013 Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league <br>\u2013 Standings: Division and conference standings <br>\u2013 Fantasy: Keep track of your favorite fantasy players <br>\u2013 Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams <br>\u2013 Social media: Aggregated twitter of the Bengals official tweets, check in to the stadium on gameday, one-click tweet of all media items, one-click Facebook posting of all media items <br>\u2013 Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games, and scores/stats of previous games from the season, ticket purchase for games <br>\u2013 Evolving home-screen: Pregame, in-game, postgame, offseason countdown, draft-day<br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen&#39;s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html for more information.<br><br>Follow us @bengals on Twitter for updates or visit bengals.com. <br><br>Follow us @yinzcam on Twitter for updates or to ask questions and provide feedback.",
